  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "倒贴豪宅的富家女，培养出中国航天之父，你敢信吗？当年被全杭州戳着脊梁蛊骂，倒贴败家的富家千金，拿三座豪宅万两白银下嫁穷书生，人人都等着看他哭着回娘家。可没人想到，二十五年后，他养出的儿子，让整个西方世界都不敢小瞧中国。一九零四年，杭州富商十七岁的女儿嫁给一个穷书生陪嫁三处豪宅集上万两白银，街坊邻居都笑她倒贴家底。后来，穷书生当上厅长，让众人闭了嘴，生下的儿子更是人人赞叹，后叫张兰娟。杭州张家的嫡出大小姐父亲紧张了。山是两广言韵史，也是江南数一数二的丝绸巨骨家底后的远近闻名，换做别家闺秀，早就养的娇生惯养，可张兰娟偏不十岁。那年，杭州闹饥荒，父亲开仓放粮赈灾，他跟着在周彭帮忙，明明按规矩，每人只能领一碗西粥。他却偷偷望每个老人兜里塞一块糕点给门口蜷说的乞丐端饭时总在饭底下买两块肉。账房先生告状说，他坏了规矩，父亲没骂他，只问他为什么这么做。他仰着头说，他们也是要脸面的人，当着面给肉，有人不好意思接。父亲当场感叹，我这女儿的眼界与心肠胜过家中十个儿郎。那句攒钱不如攒德留，才不如刘风谷，从此克尽了他的骨子里。转眼到了义亲的年纪，上门提亲的王孙公子名门望族，踏破了门槛，不是高官子弟，就是随便嫁，一个都是想不尽的荣华富贵。可张兰娟一个都没应，偏偏选中了前军夫，一个空有满腹学问语报国志向，连私塾束修都凑不齐，连见像样的长山都做不起的寒门书生消息传开，整个杭州城都炸了茶室，酒楼里人人都笑，张家小姐傻放着少奶奶不当，非要往火坑里跳。本家亲戚轮番上门劝说，门不当户不对，迟早要后悔。面对满世界的闲言碎语，张兰娟半句辩解都没有出嫁。前一天，他当着父亲的面，翻开陪嫁账本，杭州方古园老宅、上海御园洛阳楼、北京宣武门四合院，再加上万两白银压箱钱，一笔笔清清楚楚。他只说了一句话，旁人嫁人图，眼前的富贵。我图的是他心里的家国，今日我陪出去的是家产，来日他能还给这个国家，定然比这值钱百倍。婚后没过几年，前军覆响，东渡日本留学，寻找救国的路子，可凑来凑去，连船票都凑不齐。张兰娟二话不说，直接从嫁妆里划出一笔银子，连眉头都没皱一下。丈夫远走的那六年，她一个人撑起整个家上侍奉公婆，下打理产业，天不亮就起床对仗。珠算打的笔，做了一辈子的老账房，还利落。省里的珠算大赛，他连着拿了六年头名。旁人背地里说他守活寡，他全不在意。他守的从来不是空房，是两个人共同的报国念想。前军夫学成回国后，想办一所新式学堂，培养能救国的年轻人，可四处筹款都凑不齐经费。张兰娟知道后，转身就挂牌卖掉了上海的那处陪嫁洋楼，把全款交到丈夫手里，你培养人才就是救国家，我这点房产算得了什么？在他的支持下，新式学堂手利一开办，收留了不少家境贫寒的有志青年。你看，儿子钱学森，他更是把这份风骨课进了孩子的骨血里。别家孩子还在牙牙学语，背三字经。他五岁就教儿子读满江红，出师表，不讲风花雪月，只讲家国大义，别家孩子摔碎，东西要挨骂。钱学森差摔坏了家里名贵的西洋中，他反倒陪着孩子一起装回去。跟他说，拆的明白才能学的透彻，将来要靠科学，让咱们国家强起来。寒冬腊月，邻居家揭不开锅，他总带着儿子一起送米送炭，路上遇见逃难的人，他照样在饭底下悄悄买肉。年幼的钱学森问他帮得完吗？他摸着儿子的头说，帮一个是一个，咱们自己过好了，也要想着拉旁人一把。一九三五年，二十四岁的钱学森即将赴美留学，那时张兰娟早已积劳成疾，身子一天比一天差，家里人都劝他把儿子留在身边尽孝，可他硬是撑着病体收拾行李，反复叮嘱的只有一句话，出去好好学，学成了，一定要回来，祖国需要你。上海码头送别时，他捂着胸口强牙咳嗽，笑着跟儿子挥手，直到轮船消失在天际，才一口血磕在手帕上。他怕儿子分心，愣是把病情瞒得严严实实，这一别竟是母子永绝。大洋彼岸的钱爵森对着东方长贵不起。父亲寄来的信里夹着母亲临终前的字条，天快亮了，生该回家了，短短一句话成了他一辈子的执念。后来的故事我们都知道了，美国用五年软禁拦他用高官厚禄，诱他说，他一个人抵得上五个师。可他始终记着母亲的话，拼了命也要回到祖国。一九六零年，第一枚导弹腾空，一九六四年，罗布泊蘑菇云升起。一九七零年，东方红一号响彻太空。那个在母亲身边，听着家国故事长大的孩子，真的让整个中国挺直了腰杆。到这时，世人才懂张兰娟当年哪里是倒贴，哪里是糊涂。他从十岁那年就活明白了万贯家财总有散尽的一天，刻在骨学里的风骨与家国新，才是一个家族、一个民族真正的底气。多年后，钱学森在回忆录里写我的母亲是个性格开朗、热情有教养的女性。我的科学启蒙完全得益于她她教会我的，不是知识，是不怕拆开，还能装回去的胆量。当年杭州城里的街坊笑她倒贴，却不知道她最值钱的陪嫁，从来不是三处豪宅万两白银，是她在煤油灯下算题时的背影，是儿子拆钟时，他稳稳递过去的扳手，是丈夫穷困潦倒时，那具家里有我那份嫁妆，后来变成了一颗原子弹、一枚火箭，一个民族的底气。这笔账，全中国都替他算清了。他本普通无名，为国家升一栋梁，被宰史册。每个中国人都感谢他。老话说，遗金满银不如易经传家留给孩子，再多房产存款，都不如交给他，一身正气，一副担当。如果您也被这位母亲的格局打动，如果您也认可这样的家风，觉得这才是真正值得传下去的东西。评论区留下一束鲜花，转发给家里的孩子和晚辈，让他们知道什么才是最珍贵的财富。最后，想问你一句，这辈子您做过最不被人理解，但至今不后悔的决定是什么？评论区聊聊吧。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00001",
      "start_ms": 130,
      "end_ms": 1830,
      "text": "倒贴豪宅的富家女，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00002",
      "start_ms": 2050,
      "end_ms": 4290,
      "text": "培养出中国航天之父，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00003",
      "start_ms": 4750,
      "end_ms": 5730,
      "text": "你敢信吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00004",
      "start_ms": 5990,
      "end_ms": 9430,
      "text": "当年被全杭州戳着脊梁蛊骂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00005",
      "start_ms": 10230,
      "end_ms": 13210,
      "text": "倒贴败家的富家千金，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00006",
      "start_ms": 13530,
      "end_ms": 17870,
      "text": "拿三座豪宅万两白银下嫁穷书生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00007",
      "start_ms": 18330,
      "end_ms": 21410,
      "text": "人人都等着看他哭着回娘家。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00008",
      "start_ms": 22050,
      "end_ms": 23130,
      "text": "可没人想到，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00009",
      "start_ms": 23130,
      "end_ms": 24090,
      "text": "二十五年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00010",
      "start_ms": 24630,
      "end_ms": 25910,
      "text": "他养出的儿子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00011",
      "start_ms": 25910,
      "end_ms": 29875,
      "text": "让整个西方世界都不敢小瞧中国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00012",
      "start_ms": 30500,
      "end_ms": 31600,
      "text": "一九零四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00013",
      "start_ms": 32080,
      "end_ms": 41180,
      "text": "杭州富商十七岁的女儿嫁给一个穷书生陪嫁三处豪宅集上万两白银，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00014",
      "start_ms": 41440,
      "end_ms": 44120,
      "text": "街坊邻居都笑她倒贴家底。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00015",
      "start_ms": 44540,
      "end_ms": 45060,
      "text": "后来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00016",
      "start_ms": 45400,
      "end_ms": 47280,
      "text": "穷书生当上厅长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00017",
      "start_ms": 47800,
      "end_ms": 49260,
      "text": "让众人闭了嘴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00018",
      "start_ms": 50080,
      "end_ms": 53200,
      "text": "生下的儿子更是人人赞叹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00019",
      "start_ms": 54080,
      "end_ms": 55360,
      "text": "后叫张兰娟。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00020",
      "start_ms": 55860,
      "end_ms": 60530,
      "text": "杭州张家的嫡出大小姐父亲紧张了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00021",
      "start_ms": 60530,
      "end_ms": 63595,
      "text": "山是两广言韵史，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00022",
      "start_ms": 64090,
      "end_ms": 70355,
      "text": "也是江南数一数二的丝绸巨骨家底后的远近闻名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00023",
      "start_ms": 70870,
      "end_ms": 72225,
      "text": "换做别家闺秀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00024",
      "start_ms": 73040,
      "end_ms": 74845,
      "text": "早就养的娇生惯养，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00025",
      "start_ms": 75450,
      "end_ms": 78430,
      "text": "可张兰娟偏不十岁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00026",
      "start_ms": 78430,
      "end_ms": 78830,
      "text": "那年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00027",
      "start_ms": 79130,
      "end_ms": 80855,
      "text": "杭州闹饥荒，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00028",
      "start_ms": 81480,
      "end_ms": 84380,
      "text": "父亲开仓放粮赈灾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00029",
      "start_ms": 84640,
      "end_ms": 86765,
      "text": "他跟着在周彭帮忙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00030",
      "start_ms": 87720,
      "end_ms": 88800,
      "text": "明明按规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00031",
      "start_ms": 88840,
      "end_ms": 91655,
      "text": "每人只能领一碗西粥。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00032",
      "start_ms": 92170,
      "end_ms": 102075,
      "text": "他却偷偷望每个老人兜里塞一块糕点给门口蜷说的乞丐端饭时总在饭底下买两块肉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00033",
      "start_ms": 103220,
      "end_ms": 104800,
      "text": "账房先生告状说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00034",
      "start_ms": 104800,
      "end_ms": 107435,
      "text": "他坏了规矩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00035",
      "start_ms": 107940,
      "end_ms": 109125,
      "text": "父亲没骂他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00036",
      "start_ms": 110170,
      "end_ms": 111975,
      "text": "只问他为什么这么做。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00037",
      "start_ms": 112840,
      "end_ms": 114175,
      "text": "他仰着头说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00038",
      "start_ms": 115400,
      "end_ms": 117235,
      "text": "他们也是要脸面的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00039",
      "start_ms": 117960,
      "end_ms": 118900,
      "text": "当着面给肉，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00040",
      "start_ms": 119260,
      "end_ms": 120775,
      "text": "有人不好意思接。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00041",
      "start_ms": 121310,
      "end_ms": 123235,
      "text": "父亲当场感叹，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00042",
      "start_ms": 123920,
      "end_ms": 128770,
      "text": "我这女儿的眼界与心肠胜过家中十个儿郎。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00043",
      "start_ms": 128930,
      "end_ms": 131650,
      "text": "那句攒钱不如攒德留，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00044",
      "start_ms": 131690,
      "end_ms": 133229,
      "text": "才不如刘风谷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00045",
      "start_ms": 133510,
      "end_ms": 137085,
      "text": "从此克尽了他的骨子里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00046",
      "start_ms": 137390,
      "end_ms": 139625,
      "text": "转眼到了义亲的年纪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00047",
      "start_ms": 140040,
      "end_ms": 143520,
      "text": "上门提亲的王孙公子名门望族，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00048",
      "start_ms": 143680,
      "end_ms": 144795,
      "text": "踏破了门槛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00049",
      "start_ms": 145400,
      "end_ms": 146780,
      "text": "不是高官子弟，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00050",
      "start_ms": 146780,
      "end_ms": 148410,
      "text": "就是随便嫁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00051",
      "start_ms": 148410,
      "end_ms": 151335,
      "text": "一个都是想不尽的荣华富贵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00052",
      "start_ms": 151730,
      "end_ms": 153685,
      "text": "可张兰娟一个都没应，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00053",
      "start_ms": 154050,
      "end_ms": 156445,
      "text": "偏偏选中了前军夫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00054",
      "start_ms": 157340,
      "end_ms": 160960,
      "text": "一个空有满腹学问语报国志向，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00055",
      "start_ms": 161400,
      "end_ms": 163795,
      "text": "连私塾束修都凑不齐，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00056",
      "start_ms": 164340,
      "end_ms": 169600,
      "text": "连见像样的长山都做不起的寒门书生消息传开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00057",
      "start_ms": 169760,
      "end_ms": 173470,
      "text": "整个杭州城都炸了茶室，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00058",
      "start_ms": 173550,
      "end_ms": 175520,
      "text": "酒楼里人人都笑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00059",
      "start_ms": 175620,
      "end_ms": 179010,
      "text": "张家小姐傻放着少奶奶不当，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00060",
      "start_ms": 179330,
      "end_ms": 181065,
      "text": "非要往火坑里跳。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00061",
      "start_ms": 181980,
      "end_ms": 185210,
      "text": "本家亲戚轮番上门劝说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00062",
      "start_ms": 185250,
      "end_ms": 186515,
      "text": "门不当户不对，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00063",
      "start_ms": 187070,
      "end_ms": 188085,
      "text": "迟早要后悔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00064",
      "start_ms": 188740,
      "end_ms": 191475,
      "text": "面对满世界的闲言碎语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00065",
      "start_ms": 191830,
      "end_ms": 195550,
      "text": "张兰娟半句辩解都没有出嫁。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00066",
      "start_ms": 195550,
      "end_ms": 196130,
      "text": "前一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00067",
      "start_ms": 196430,
      "end_ms": 197825,
      "text": "他当着父亲的面，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00068",
      "start_ms": 198260,
      "end_ms": 199725,
      "text": "翻开陪嫁账本，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00069",
      "start_ms": 200020,
      "end_ms": 206825,
      "text": "杭州方古园老宅、上海御园洛阳楼、北京宣武门四合院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00070",
      "start_ms": 207820,
      "end_ms": 210620,
      "text": "再加上万两白银压箱钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00071",
      "start_ms": 210680,
      "end_ms": 212665,
      "text": "一笔笔清清楚楚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00072",
      "start_ms": 213190,
      "end_ms": 214655,
      "text": "他只说了一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00073",
      "start_ms": 215180,
      "end_ms": 217390,
      "text": "旁人嫁人图，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00074",
      "start_ms": 217490,
      "end_ms": 218785,
      "text": "眼前的富贵。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00075",
      "start_ms": 219310,
      "end_ms": 222125,
      "text": "我图的是他心里的家国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00076",
      "start_ms": 222880,
      "end_ms": 225485,
      "text": "今日我陪出去的是家产，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00077",
      "start_ms": 226190,
      "end_ms": 229605,
      "text": "来日他能还给这个国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00078",
      "start_ms": 230010,
      "end_ms": 232305,
      "text": "定然比这值钱百倍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00079",
      "start_ms": 233200,
      "end_ms": 234995,
      "text": "婚后没过几年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00080",
      "start_ms": 235860,
      "end_ms": 236980,
      "text": "前军覆响，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00081",
      "start_ms": 237040,
      "end_ms": 239470,
      "text": "东渡日本留学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00082",
      "start_ms": 239950,
      "end_ms": 241705,
      "text": "寻找救国的路子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00083",
      "start_ms": 242990,
      "end_ms": 244365,
      "text": "可凑来凑去，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00084",
      "start_ms": 244800,
      "end_ms": 246695,
      "text": "连船票都凑不齐。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00085",
      "start_ms": 247090,
      "end_ms": 248755,
      "text": "张兰娟二话不说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00086",
      "start_ms": 249260,
      "end_ms": 252515,
      "text": "直接从嫁妆里划出一笔银子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00087",
      "start_ms": 252880,
      "end_ms": 254725,
      "text": "连眉头都没皱一下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00088",
      "start_ms": 255390,
      "end_ms": 257170,
      "text": "丈夫远走的那六年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00089",
      "start_ms": 257370,
      "end_ms": 260805,
      "text": "她一个人撑起整个家上侍奉公婆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00090",
      "start_ms": 261240,
      "end_ms": 262495,
      "text": "下打理产业，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00091",
      "start_ms": 262860,
      "end_ms": 264525,
      "text": "天不亮就起床对仗。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00092",
      "start_ms": 265300,
      "end_ms": 266600,
      "text": "珠算打的笔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00093",
      "start_ms": 266640,
      "end_ms": 270445,
      "text": "做了一辈子的老账房，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00094",
      "start_ms": 270740,
      "end_ms": 271555,
      "text": "还利落。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00095",
      "start_ms": 273030,
      "end_ms": 274815,
      "text": "省里的珠算大赛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00096",
      "start_ms": 275400,
      "end_ms": 277235,
      "text": "他连着拿了六年头名。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00097",
      "start_ms": 277720,
      "end_ms": 280925,
      "text": "旁人背地里说他守活寡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00098",
      "start_ms": 281720,
      "end_ms": 282765,
      "text": "他全不在意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00099",
      "start_ms": 283680,
      "end_ms": 285795,
      "text": "他守的从来不是空房，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00100",
      "start_ms": 286230,
      "end_ms": 290115,
      "text": "是两个人共同的报国念想。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00101",
      "start_ms": 291760,
      "end_ms": 293720,
      "text": "前军夫学成回国后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00102",
      "start_ms": 294260,
      "end_ms": 296120,
      "text": "想办一所新式学堂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00103",
      "start_ms": 296220,
      "end_ms": 297980,
      "text": "培养能救国的年轻人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00104",
      "start_ms": 298480,
      "end_ms": 301560,
      "text": "可四处筹款都凑不齐经费。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00105",
      "start_ms": 301680,
      "end_ms": 303000,
      "text": "张兰娟知道后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00106",
      "start_ms": 303280,
      "end_ms": 308340,
      "text": "转身就挂牌卖掉了上海的那处陪嫁洋楼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00107",
      "start_ms": 308680,
      "end_ms": 311080,
      "text": "把全款交到丈夫手里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00108",
      "start_ms": 311580,
      "end_ms": 314140,
      "text": "你培养人才就是救国家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00109",
      "start_ms": 314620,
      "end_ms": 317300,
      "text": "我这点房产算得了什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00110",
      "start_ms": 318620,
      "end_ms": 319880,
      "text": "在他的支持下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00111",
      "start_ms": 320200,
      "end_ms": 322530,
      "text": "新式学堂手利一开办，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00112",
      "start_ms": 322530,
      "end_ms": 325950,
      "text": "收留了不少家境贫寒的有志青年。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00113",
      "start_ms": 327030,
      "end_ms": 327410,
      "text": "你看，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00114",
      "start_ms": 327410,
      "end_ms": 328410,
      "text": "儿子钱学森，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00115",
      "start_ms": 329210,
      "end_ms": 333550,
      "text": "他更是把这份风骨课进了孩子的骨血里。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00116",
      "start_ms": 333850,
      "end_ms": 336850,
      "text": "别家孩子还在牙牙学语，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00117",
      "start_ms": 336950,
      "end_ms": 337850,
      "text": "背三字经。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00118",
      "start_ms": 338430,
      "end_ms": 341450,
      "text": "他五岁就教儿子读满江红，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00119",
      "start_ms": 341610,
      "end_ms": 342230,
      "text": "出师表，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00120",
      "start_ms": 342370,
      "end_ms": 343890,
      "text": "不讲风花雪月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00121",
      "start_ms": 344330,
      "end_ms": 345990,
      "text": "只讲家国大义，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00122",
      "start_ms": 346590,
      "end_ms": 348330,
      "text": "别家孩子摔碎，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00123",
      "start_ms": 348350,
      "end_ms": 349710,
      "text": "东西要挨骂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00124",
      "start_ms": 350370,
      "end_ms": 354030,
      "text": "钱学森差摔坏了家里名贵的西洋中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00125",
      "start_ms": 354370,
      "end_ms": 357345,
      "text": "他反倒陪着孩子一起装回去。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00126",
      "start_ms": 357930,
      "end_ms": 358530,
      "text": "跟他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00127",
      "start_ms": 358570,
      "end_ms": 360965,
      "text": "拆的明白才能学的透彻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00128",
      "start_ms": 361460,
      "end_ms": 362680,
      "text": "将来要靠科学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00129",
      "start_ms": 362700,
      "end_ms": 364955,
      "text": "让咱们国家强起来。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00130",
      "start_ms": 365430,
      "end_ms": 366565,
      "text": "寒冬腊月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00131",
      "start_ms": 366960,
      "end_ms": 368635,
      "text": "邻居家揭不开锅，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00132",
      "start_ms": 369150,
      "end_ms": 372825,
      "text": "他总带着儿子一起送米送炭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00133",
      "start_ms": 373340,
      "end_ms": 375215,
      "text": "路上遇见逃难的人，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00134",
      "start_ms": 375620,
      "end_ms": 378865,
      "text": "他照样在饭底下悄悄买肉。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00135",
      "start_ms": 379520,
      "end_ms": 382670,
      "text": "年幼的钱学森问他帮得完吗？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00136",
      "start_ms": 382810,
      "end_ms": 384545,
      "text": "他摸着儿子的头说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00137",
      "start_ms": 385060,
      "end_ms": 386185,
      "text": "帮一个是一个，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00138",
      "start_ms": 387410,
      "end_ms": 388815,
      "text": "咱们自己过好了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00139",
      "start_ms": 389120,
      "end_ms": 391115,
      "text": "也要想着拉旁人一把。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00140",
      "start_ms": 392000,
      "end_ms": 393180,
      "text": "一九三五年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00141",
      "start_ms": 393200,
      "end_ms": 397155,
      "text": "二十四岁的钱学森即将赴美留学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00142",
      "start_ms": 397850,
      "end_ms": 401105,
      "text": "那时张兰娟早已积劳成疾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00143",
      "start_ms": 401610,
      "end_ms": 403445,
      "text": "身子一天比一天差，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00144",
      "start_ms": 404080,
      "end_ms": 408175,
      "text": "家里人都劝他把儿子留在身边尽孝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00145",
      "start_ms": 408790,
      "end_ms": 411995,
      "text": "可他硬是撑着病体收拾行李，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00146",
      "start_ms": 412310,
      "end_ms": 415035,
      "text": "反复叮嘱的只有一句话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00147",
      "start_ms": 415840,
      "end_ms": 417125,
      "text": "出去好好学，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00148",
      "start_ms": 417580,
      "end_ms": 418260,
      "text": "学成了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00149",
      "start_ms": 418260,
      "end_ms": 419315,
      "text": "一定要回来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00150",
      "start_ms": 419760,
      "end_ms": 421465,
      "text": "祖国需要你。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00151",
      "start_ms": 422260,
      "end_ms": 424185,
      "text": "上海码头送别时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00152",
      "start_ms": 424530,
      "end_ms": 426870,
      "text": "他捂着胸口强牙咳嗽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00153",
      "start_ms": 427150,
      "end_ms": 428705,
      "text": "笑着跟儿子挥手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00154",
      "start_ms": 429130,
      "end_ms": 431425,
      "text": "直到轮船消失在天际，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00155",
      "start_ms": 431740,
      "end_ms": 433765,
      "text": "才一口血磕在手帕上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00156",
      "start_ms": 434580,
      "end_ms": 435915,
      "text": "他怕儿子分心，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00157",
      "start_ms": 436470,
      "end_ms": 439245,
      "text": "愣是把病情瞒得严严实实，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00158",
      "start_ms": 440040,
      "end_ms": 442605,
      "text": "这一别竟是母子永绝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00159",
      "start_ms": 443300,
      "end_ms": 446955,
      "text": "大洋彼岸的钱爵森对着东方长贵不起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00160",
      "start_ms": 447570,
      "end_ms": 451685,
      "text": "父亲寄来的信里夹着母亲临终前的字条，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00161",
      "start_ms": 452250,
      "end_ms": 453135,
      "text": "天快亮了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00162",
      "start_ms": 453730,
      "end_ms": 454995,
      "text": "生该回家了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00163",
      "start_ms": 457060,
      "end_ms": 460585,
      "text": "短短一句话成了他一辈子的执念。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00164",
      "start_ms": 461820,
      "end_ms": 463905,
      "text": "后来的故事我们都知道了，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00165",
      "start_ms": 464250,
      "end_ms": 468845,
      "text": "美国用五年软禁拦他用高官厚禄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00166",
      "start_ms": 469180,
      "end_ms": 470040,
      "text": "诱他说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00167",
      "start_ms": 470040,
      "end_ms": 472445,
      "text": "他一个人抵得上五个师。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00168",
      "start_ms": 472800,
      "end_ms": 475460,
      "text": "可他始终记着母亲的话，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00169",
      "start_ms": 475760,
      "end_ms": 477975,
      "text": "拼了命也要回到祖国。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00170",
      "start_ms": 478570,
      "end_ms": 479765,
      "text": "一九六零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00171",
      "start_ms": 480060,
      "end_ms": 481895,
      "text": "第一枚导弹腾空，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00172",
      "start_ms": 483100,
      "end_ms": 484140,
      "text": "一九六四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00173",
      "start_ms": 484160,
      "end_ms": 486615,
      "text": "罗布泊蘑菇云升起。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00174",
      "start_ms": 487090,
      "end_ms": 488230,
      "text": "一九七零年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00175",
      "start_ms": 488350,
      "end_ms": 491185,
      "text": "东方红一号响彻太空。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00176",
      "start_ms": 491830,
      "end_ms": 493070,
      "text": "那个在母亲身边，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00177",
      "start_ms": 493150,
      "end_ms": 496035,
      "text": "听着家国故事长大的孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00178",
      "start_ms": 496550,
      "end_ms": 500025,
      "text": "真的让整个中国挺直了腰杆。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00179",
      "start_ms": 500860,
      "end_ms": 501520,
      "text": "到这时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00180",
      "start_ms": 501560,
      "end_ms": 507805,
      "text": "世人才懂张兰娟当年哪里是倒贴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00181",
      "start_ms": 508390,
      "end_ms": 509995,
      "text": "哪里是糊涂。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00182",
      "start_ms": 511050,
      "end_ms": 518635,
      "text": "他从十岁那年就活明白了万贯家财总有散尽的一天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00183",
      "start_ms": 519430,
      "end_ms": 522985,
      "text": "刻在骨学里的风骨与家国新，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00184",
      "start_ms": 523430,
      "end_ms": 527525,
      "text": "才是一个家族、一个民族真正的底气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00185",
      "start_ms": 528200,
      "end_ms": 528840,
      "text": "多年后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00186",
      "start_ms": 528840,
      "end_ms": 537000,
      "text": "钱学森在回忆录里写我的母亲是个性格开朗、热情有教养的女性。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00187",
      "start_ms": 537600,
      "end_ms": 542460,
      "text": "我的科学启蒙完全得益于她她教会我的，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00188",
      "start_ms": 542460,
      "end_ms": 543340,
      "text": "不是知识，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00189",
      "start_ms": 543700,
      "end_ms": 544900,
      "text": "是不怕拆开，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00190",
      "start_ms": 545200,
      "end_ms": 546800,
      "text": "还能装回去的胆量。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00191",
      "start_ms": 547400,
      "end_ms": 550580,
      "text": "当年杭州城里的街坊笑她倒贴，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00192",
      "start_ms": 551080,
      "end_ms": 553980,
      "text": "却不知道她最值钱的陪嫁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00193",
      "start_ms": 554060,
      "end_ms": 557580,
      "text": "从来不是三处豪宅万两白银，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00194",
      "start_ms": 558060,
      "end_ms": 561390,
      "text": "是她在煤油灯下算题时的背影，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00195",
      "start_ms": 561770,
      "end_ms": 563250,
      "text": "是儿子拆钟时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00196",
      "start_ms": 563250,
      "end_ms": 565270,
      "text": "他稳稳递过去的扳手，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00197",
      "start_ms": 565830,
      "end_ms": 567970,
      "text": "是丈夫穷困潦倒时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00198",
      "start_ms": 567990,
      "end_ms": 571850,
      "text": "那具家里有我那份嫁妆，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00199",
      "start_ms": 572350,
      "end_ms": 575630,
      "text": "后来变成了一颗原子弹、一枚火箭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00200",
      "start_ms": 575870,
      "end_ms": 577470,
      "text": "一个民族的底气。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00201",
      "start_ms": 578490,
      "end_ms": 579210,
      "text": "这笔账，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00202",
      "start_ms": 579690,
      "end_ms": 582090,
      "text": "全中国都替他算清了。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00203",
      "start_ms": 582870,
      "end_ms": 584230,
      "text": "他本普通无名，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00204",
      "start_ms": 584530,
      "end_ms": 586150,
      "text": "为国家升一栋梁，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00205",
      "start_ms": 587230,
      "end_ms": 588310,
      "text": "被宰史册。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00206",
      "start_ms": 588830,
      "end_ms": 590765,
      "text": "每个中国人都感谢他。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00207",
      "start_ms": 591780,
      "end_ms": 592500,
      "text": "老话说，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00208",
      "start_ms": 592880,
      "end_ms": 597190,
      "text": "遗金满银不如易经传家留给孩子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00209",
      "start_ms": 597190,
      "end_ms": 599070,
      "text": "再多房产存款，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00210",
      "start_ms": 599350,
      "end_ms": 600645,
      "text": "都不如交给他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00211",
      "start_ms": 601100,
      "end_ms": 602215,
      "text": "一身正气，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00212",
      "start_ms": 602550,
      "end_ms": 603545,
      "text": "一副担当。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00213",
      "start_ms": 604020,
      "end_ms": 607785,
      "text": "如果您也被这位母亲的格局打动，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00214",
      "start_ms": 608190,
      "end_ms": 611445,
      "text": "如果您也认可这样的家风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00215",
      "start_ms": 611800,
      "end_ms": 615905,
      "text": "觉得这才是真正值得传下去的东西。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00216",
      "start_ms": 616350,
      "end_ms": 618050,
      "text": "评论区留下一束鲜花，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00217",
      "start_ms": 618490,
      "end_ms": 622115,
      "text": "转发给家里的孩子和晚辈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00218",
      "start_ms": 622530,
      "end_ms": 627045,
      "text": "让他们知道什么才是最珍贵的财富。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00219",
      "start_ms": 628500,
      "end_ms": 628840,
      "text": "最后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00220",
      "start_ms": 628840,
      "end_ms": 629855,
      "text": "想问你一句，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00221",
      "start_ms": 630400,
      "end_ms": 634485,
      "text": "这辈子您做过最不被人理解，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00222",
      "start_ms": 635300,
      "end_ms": 639225,
      "text": "但至今不后悔的决定是什么？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_1ceae1131ac714ed_s00223",
      "start_ms": 640760,
      "end_ms": 641825,
      "text": "评论区聊聊吧。"
    }
  ],
